  [38;5;246mFires ahead of the due date by a configurable lead time (e.g. 1 day before). Derived from dueDate — no extra task [39m
  [38;5;246mfields.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Overdue
  [38;5;246mFires once a task passes its due date without being completed. Also derived from dueDate.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Daily digest
  [38;5;246mOne notification at a set time each morning summarizing what's due today. Replaces a stream of individual pings with a
[39m  [38;5;246msingle predictable one.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Per-task custom reminder
  [38;5;246mSet an arbitrary reminder time on an individual task, independent of its due date. Adds a second time field and more [39m
  [38;5;246mscheduling logic.[39m
